{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0266-s001", "text": "Du kan gå på graviditetsledighet 14–30 vardagar före det beräknade förlossningsdatumet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraledighet/narration-resume-20261103T025939433550Z/hb-c09-u0266-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.916462585034013, "peak": 0.285552978515625, "generation_seconds": 34.34244791395031, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0266-s002", "text": "Då får du graviditetspenning.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraledighet/narration-resume-20261103T025939433550Z/hb-c09-u0266-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 2.8560544217687074, "peak": 0.300811767578125, "generation_seconds": 13.55746153392829, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0266-s003", "text": "Den betalas i 40 vardagar, alltså ungefär 1,5 månader.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraledighet/narration-resume-20261103T025939433550Z/hb-c09-u0266-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.408707482993197, "peak": 0.3115234375, "generation_seconds": 26.627244039904326, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0267-s001", "text": "Du kan få graviditetspenning om följande villkor uppfylls:", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraledighet/narration-resume-20261103T025939433550Z/hb-c09-u0267-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.50312925170068, "peak": 0.29339599609375, "generation_seconds": 21.173023185925558, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0268-s001", "text": "Du är den förälder som ska föda barnet och graviditeten har varat i 154 dagar.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraledighet/narration-resume-20261103T025939433550Z/hb-c09-u0268-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.289523809523809, "peak": 0.2821044921875, "generation_seconds": 30.828971039969474, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0270-s001", "text": "Du är borta från ditt arbete.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraledighet/narration-resume-20261103T025939433550Z/hb-c09-u0270-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 2.8560544217687074, "peak": 0.358856201171875, "generation_seconds": 13.250842506997287, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0271-s001", "text": "Du har rätt till FPA:s stöd.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraledighet/narration-resume-20261103T025939433550Z/hb-c09-u0271-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 2.995374149659864, "peak": 0.296539306640625, "generation_seconds": 15.045709870988503, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0272-s001", "text": "Du kan få graviditetspenning också om du är studerande eller arbetslös.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraledighet/narration-resume-20261103T025939433550Z/hb-c09-u0272-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.408707482993197, "peak": 0.3560791015625, "generation_seconds": 23.066100591095164, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0273-s001", "text": "Efter graviditetspenningperioden kan du vara föräldraledig och få föräldrapenning.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraledighet/narration-resume-20261103T030306785217Z/hb-c09-u0273-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.1053061224489795, "peak": 0.2996826171875, "generation_seconds": 25.173837174894288, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0274-s001", "text": "Du kan få föräldrapenning från FPA om följande villkor uppfylls:", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraledighet/narration-resume-20261103T030306785217Z/hb-c09-u0274-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.408707482993197, "peak": 0.239044189453125, "generation_seconds": 23.664234078954905, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0275-s001", "text": "Du vårdar ett barn som är under två år eller ett adoptivbarn som tagits i vård för mindre än två år sedan hemma.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraledighet/narration-resume-20261103T030306785217Z/hb-c09-u0275-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.543401360544218, "peak": 0.394683837890625, "generation_seconds": 33.98804268985987, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0277-s001", "text": "Du arbetar inte.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraledighet/narration-resume-20261103T030306785217Z/hb-c09-u0277-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 2.089795918367347, "peak": 0.306488037109375, "generation_seconds": 8.130543109029531, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0278-s001", "text": "Du har rätt till FPA:s stöd.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraledighet/narration-resume-20261103T030306785217Z/hb-c09-u0278-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 2.995374149659864, "peak": 0.290985107421875, "generation_seconds": 12.275910523952916, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0279-s001", "text": "Om du är den förälder som ska föda barnet kan du få föräldrapenning direkt efter att graviditetspenningperioden har upphört, även om barnet inte skulle ha fötts ännu.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraledighet/narration-resume-20261103T030306785217Z/hb-c09-u0279-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 13.862312925170068, "peak": 0.308624267578125, "generation_seconds": 43.89439759706147, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0280-s001", "text": "Om du är den förälder som inte ska föda barnet kan du inleda föräldrapenningperioden så fort barnet har fötts.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraledighet/narration-resume-20261103T030306785217Z/hb-c09-u0280-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.613061224489796, "peak": 0.264312744140625, "generation_seconds": 32.67143300594762, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0281-s001", "text": "Föräldrarna kan få föräldrapenning för sammanlagt 320 vardagar, alltså ungefär 13 månader.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraledighet/narration-resume-20261103T030306785217Z/hb-c09-u0281-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.100680272108843, "peak": 0.42578125, "generation_seconds": 37.254089068155736, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0281-s002", "text": "Vardera föräldern har rätt till hälften av föräldrapenningdagarna, alltså 160 dagar.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraledighet/narration-resume-20261103T030716679730Z/hb-c09-u0281-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.916462585034013, "peak": 0.35614013671875, "generation_seconds": 29.71161815803498, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0282-s001", "text": "Om du är barnets enda vårdnadshavare, kan du använda alla 320 vardagar och få föräldrapenning under en längre period.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraledighet/narration-resume-20261103T030716679730Z/hb-c09-u0282-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.633197278911565, "peak": 0.4110107421875, "generation_seconds": 45.35869836388156, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0283-s001", "text": "Om familjen får tvillingar kan ni få föräldrapenning för ytterligare 84 vardagar.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraledighet/narration-resume-20261103T030716679730Z/hb-c09-u0283-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.6378231292517, "peak": 0.230133056640625, "generation_seconds": 30.168657297967002, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0284-s001", "text": "Du kan få föräldrapenning flexibelt när du vill fram till dess att barnet fyller två år.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraledighet/narration-resume-20261103T030716679730Z/hb-c09-u0284-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.314285714285714, "peak": 0.3216552734375, "generation_seconds": 29.440019594039768, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0285-s001", "text": "Du kan överlåta högst 63 vardagar av din föräldrapenningkvot på 160 vardagar till barnets andra förälder.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraledighet/narration-resume-20261103T030716679730Z/hb-c09-u0285-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.981496598639456, "peak": 0.364990234375, "generation_seconds": 42.42692799703218, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0286-s001", "text": "Beloppet på föräldradagpenningen beror på din årsinkomst.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraledighet/narration-resume-20261103T030716679730Z/hb-c09-u0286-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.085170068027211, "peak": 0.277099609375, "generation_seconds": 18.283633566927165, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0286-s002", "text": "Föräldrapenningen är alltid mindre än lönen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraledighet/narration-resume-20261103T030716679730Z/hb-c09-u0286-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.179591836734694, "peak": 0.388824462890625, "generation_seconds": 12.234456619946286, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0435-s001", "text": "Om du inte har några inkomster, får du föräldrapenningens minimibelopp.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraledighet/narration-resume-20261103T030716679730Z/hb-c09-u0435-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.548027210884354, "peak": 0.239898681640625, "generation_seconds": 20.821450575022027, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0287-s001", "text": "Ta i god tid reda på om din arbetsgivare betalar ut lön för föräldraledigheten.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraledighet/narration-resume-20261103T031141362063Z/hb-c09-u0287-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.1053061224489795, "peak": 0.26739501953125, "generation_seconds": 21.115679431939498, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0287-s002", "text": "Du behöver denna uppgift till din ansökan om föräldrapenning.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraledighet/narration-resume-20261103T031141362063Z/hb-c09-u0287-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.50312925170068, "peak": 0.338470458984375, "generation_seconds": 16.618521645898, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0287-s003", "text": "Om du får lön för föräldraledigheten, betalar FPA föräldrapenningen för denna period till din arbetsgivare.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraledighet/narration-resume-20261103T031141362063Z/hb-c09-u0287-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.309659863945578, "peak": 0.237060546875, "generation_seconds": 27.667861240915954, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0288-s001", "text": "Om du tar hand om barnet under en del av dagen och har ett deltidsarbete samtidigt, kan du ansöka om partiell föräldrapenning.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraledighet/narration-resume-20261103T031141362063Z/hb-c09-u0288-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.00625850340136, "peak": 0.25616455078125, "generation_seconds": 30.442091438919306, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0288-s002", "text": "Din dagliga arbetstid får vara högst fem timmar om dagen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraledighet/narration-resume-20261103T031141362063Z/hb-c09-u0288-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.224489795918367, "peak": 0.27703857421875, "generation_seconds": 19.99459007009864, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0288-s003", "text": "Om du har en anställning, måste du ha ett avtal om deltidsarbete med din arbetsgivare.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraledighet/narration-resume-20261103T031141362063Z/hb-c09-u0288-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.732244897959184, "peak": 0.29632568359375, "generation_seconds": 24.728223211830482, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0289-s001", "text": "Föräldrarna kan också arbeta deltid och sköta barnet växelvis eller samtidigt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraledighet/narration-resume-20261103T031141362063Z/hb-c09-u0289-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.1053061224489795, "peak": 0.32098388671875, "generation_seconds": 20.007043802877888, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0289-s002", "text": "För denna tid betalar FPA partiell föräldrapenning till båda föräldrarna.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraledighet/narration-resume-20261103T031141362063Z/hb-c09-u0289-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.174965986394557, "peak": 0.2943115234375, "generation_seconds": 24.366447855951265, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
